<title>UK: Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Astra AB.</title>
<headline>Merrill Lynch sets warrants on Astra AB.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merrill Lynch International &amp; Co. CV has issued one million American-style call warrants, on Astra AB &quot;A' shares, lead manager Merrill Lynch International said.</p>
<p>One warrant controls one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    336.5 SEK		 PREMIUM	8.52 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     28.7 SEK		  GEARING	11.72 X</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	04.JUN.97		 PAYDATE	24.DEC.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   LONDON		    MIN EXER LOT 1000</p>
<p>SPOT REFERENCE  336.5 SEK</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
